==Hooks==
</noinclude>{{DYK bottom prep notice}}
{{main page image/DYK|image=File:Torre CBNM.png|caption=The Torre CBNM in Sant Cristòfor, headquarters of the Corporació Bancària del Nou Món}}

* ... that the '''[[Vaiahi-Okaiken Friendship Treaty]]''' of 1975 established a labor corridor and free movement between the [[Vaiahi Islands|Vaiahi]] islands and Okaiken, but was criticized for creating a dependency relationship that undermined Vaiahi sovereignty?

* ... that '''[[Hiroshi Nakajima]]''', Okaiken's current Minister of Justice, is a former prosecutor now leading the Kizan prosecution — the first major test of the Institutional Accountability Act?

* ... that '''[[Okaiken-Varkana relations|bilateral relations between Okaiken and Varkana]]''' are anchored by the Treaty of Klow, energy cooperation, and shared sporting ties including the 2014 [[Adonian Football Association|AFA]] World Cup hosted by Varkana?

* ... that the '''[[Baliscan avant-garde]]''' (Avantguardismo baliscano) was an artistic and architectural movement active from the 1890s to the 1970s, drawing on Futurism, anarchist aesthetics, and indigenous traditions in Balisca?

* ... that '''Huwei''' has over 550 skyscrapers — the most of any city in the world — while '''Jungsaan''' has over 400 and the most buildings taller than 200 metres?

* ... that the '''[[Languages of Balisca]]''' reflect the country's diverse cultural mosaic, encompassing Baliscano, Kurupiran, Kuarupí, and {{W|Judaeo-Spanish|Ladino}}?

* ... that the '''[[Luminau|Sultanate of Luminau]]''' (Negara Luminau Darul Islah) is a country in North Fosia whose official name is rendered in both Latin and Chinese scripts?

* ... that the '''[[States of Sanrobonia]]''' comprise 34 states — plus one disputed territory, Bahari Selatan — making up the constituent entities of [[Sanrobonia]]?

* ... that the '''[[Corporació Bancària del Nou Món]]''' (CBNM), founded in 1789 as the Banc Volisanià d'Estranger, is headquartered in the 200-metre, 46-story '''[[Torre CBNM]]''' (pictured) in [[Sant Cristòfor]]?

* ... that the '''[[List of wealthiest Balboans by net worth|list of wealthiest Balboans]]''' is compiled from publicly disclosed ownership stakes in companies listed on the [[Bolsa de Sant Cristòfor]], and does not include private assets or real estate?

